17
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:34,440
"Won't he be cold at night?" asked Fern.

18
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:41,399
"No," said her father. You watch and see what he does. Carrying a bottle of milk,

19
00:01:41,399 --> 00:01:47,240
Fern sat down under the apple tree inside the yard. Wilbur ran to her and

20
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:52,039
she held the bottle for him while he sucked. When he had finished the last

21
00:01:52,039 --> 00:01:57,879
drop, he grunted and walked sleepily into the box.

22
00:01:57,879 --> 00:02:04,919
Fern peered through the door. Wilbur was poking the straw with his snout. In a

23
