25
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:26,958
It relieved her mind to know that her baby would sleep covered up and would stay warm.

26
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:32,039
Every morning after breakfast, Wilbur walked out to the road with Fern and

27
00:02:32,039 --> 00:02:37,159
waited with her till the bus came. She would wave goodbye to him and he would

28
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:42,440
stand and watch the bus until it vanished around a turn. While Fern was

29
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:48,600
in school, Wilbur was shut up inside his yard. But as soon as she got home in the

30
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:54,839
afternoon, she would take him out and he would follow her around the place.

31
00:02:54,839 --> 00:03:01,559
If she went into the house, Wilbur went too. If she went upstairs, Wilbur would

32
00:03:01,559 --> 00:03:06,759
wait at the bottom step until she came down again. If she took her doll for a

33
