the carriage alongside the doll. He liked this.

36
00:03:22,919 --> 00:03:28,679
And if he was very tired, he would close his eyes and go to sleep under the

37
00:03:28,679 --> 00:03:34,200
doll's blanket. He looked cute when his eyes were closed because his lashes were

38
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:40,759
