40
00:03:46,919 --> 00:03:52,600
One warm afternoon, Fern and Avery put on bathing suits and went down to the

41
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:59,320
brook for a swim. Wilbur tagged along at Fern's heels. When she waited into the

42
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:06,200
brook, Wilbur waited in with her. He found the water quite cold, too cold for

43
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:11,480
his liking. So while the children swam and played and splashed water at each

44
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:16,919
